        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana VH65, Valet Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this valet hook features a folding hook arm with 5 slots for hangers. It can mounted to your wall or the inside of closet doors. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware. Manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019s most complete provider for all your door hardware needs. The Solid Brass Folding Valet Hook has a 7-3/4 inch total length and a 1-3/8 inch projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-VH65-size.gif?v=1704354572\" width=\"599\" height=\"112\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana VH65 Valet Wall Hook Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana VH65 Valet Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Plate Height: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Base Plate Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Hook Arm Length: 6-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Minimum Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/VH65.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana VH65 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
