                "description": "Valet Hook Deltana VH65 - Made of solid brass, this valet hook features a folding hook arm with 5 slots for hangers. It can mounted to your wall or the inside of closet doors. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware. Manufactured by Deltana, the nation\u0019s most complete provider for all your door hardware needs. The Solid Brass Folding Valet Hook has a 7-3/4 inch total length and a 1-3/8 inch projection.\r\n",
